{
  "kind": "flow-node",
  "version": 2,
  "tool": "corridoor",
  "meta": {
    "label": "Corridoor",
    "category": "Partition",
    "color": "#0d9488"
  },
  "description": "A pure CALCULATION node — carve a corridor through the polygon: coordinates in, coordinates out. Draws nothing on canvas.",
  "instructions": "A value-only node: it takes a polygon as a coordinate LIST and returns the result as a coordinate list. It has no geometry input or output and draws nothing on the canvas — wire val-polygons into a Polygon node when you want it drawn.\n\nINPUT: `polygon` takes the outline as JSON [[x,y],...] metre pairs, local to the anchor. Wire Space Geometry's val-points into valin-polygon. A nested [[[x,y],...],...] list is accepted too — the LARGEST piece is used, since this node works on one polygon.\n\nOUTPUT: val-polygons publishes the result as a nested [[[x,y],...],...] list, which a Polygon node accepts directly.\n\nEvery parameter is wireable (valin-*).",
  "handles": {
    "input": false,
    "output": false,
    "valueInputs": [
      {
        "key": "polygon",
        "label": "Polygon"
      },
      {
        "key": "shape",
        "label": "Shape"
      },
      {
        "key": "width",
        "label": "Width"
      },
      {
        "key": "offset",
        "label": "Inset offset"
      },
      {
        "key": "count",
        "label": "Cells (n)"
      }
    ],
    "valueOutputs": [
      {
        "key": "polygons",
        "label": "Polygons (JSON)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "vars": {
    "isInset": "shape == 'insetted'",
    "isPath": "shape == 'skeleton' || shape == 'bsp' || shape == 'split'"
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "key": "polygon",
      "label": "Polygon (JSON)",
      "kind": "text",
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "shape",
      "label": "Shape",
      "kind": "select",
      "default": "horizontal",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "horizontal",
          "label": "Horizontal band"
        },
        {
          "value": "vertical",
          "label": "Vertical band"
        },
        {
          "value": "cross",
          "label": "Cross"
        },
        {
          "value": "insetted",
          "label": "Insetted loop"
        },
        {
          "value": "skeleton",
          "label": "Skeleton path"
        },
        {
          "value": "bsp",
          "label": "BSP path"
        },
        {
          "value": "split",
          "label": "Split path"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "width",
      "label": "Width",
      "kind": "range",
      "default": 1.2,
      "min": 0.1,
      "max": 10,
      "step": 0.1,
      "unit": "m"
    },
    {
      "key": "offset",
      "label": "Inset offset",
      "kind": "range",
      "default": 0.5,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 0.1,
      "unit": "m",
      "showWhen": "isInset"
    },
    {
      "key": "count",
      "label": "Cells (n)",
      "kind": "range",
      "default": 3,
      "min": 2,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 1,
      "showWhen": "isPath"
    }
  ]
}
